    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> be the orders of the reaction with respect to the reactants <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Rate</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi>Rate</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi>Rate</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y